==Battleground==
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*5 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~20 seconds<sup>200f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Bore]] spawns.

==Strategy==
This stage isn't to hard to deal with if you were able to beat a level of [[Baron Seal Strikes]]. Even so, anti-red units like [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier]], [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Roe cat]], or even just regular attackers should work as long as you can meatshield the [[Bore]] enough.

